{"id":"17481145f095cfb1","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-algebraic-structure.md","title":"Algebraic Structure","display":"df-algebraic-structure — Algebraic Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-algebraic-structure","aliases":["58-df-algebraic-structure","Algebraic Structure"],"display":"df-algebraic-structure — Algebraic Structure","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-algebraic-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-algebraic-structure</span><span>Algebraic Structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebraic-structure — Algebraic Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"788f4256d9b974d6\" href=\"?note=788f4256d9b974d6\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md\">../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,A&#39;\\in V\">\\(A,A&#39;\\in V\\)</span> (underlying sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;\\in V\">\\(I,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded arity-index and operation families)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S\\)</span> (代数结构谓词, defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S\\)</span> (同态谓词, defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Substructure}_S\\)</span> (子结构谓词, defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\Omega\">\\(\\tau_\\Omega\\)</span> (operation arity profile, defined in this file)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(I))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega(n),I(n),A^{A^n})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(I))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega(n),I(n),A^{A^n})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure\\text{-}arity} \\vdash \\tau_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,|I(i)|\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure\\text{-}arity} \\vdash \\tau_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,|I(i)|\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Substructure}_S(B,A,\\Omega,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\land\\varnothing\\neq B\\subseteq A\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in I(n)\\;\\forall\\bar b\\in B^n\\;(\\Omega(n)(i)(\\bar b)\\in B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Substructure}_S(B,A,\\Omega,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\land\\varnothing\\neq B\\subseteq A\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in I(n)\\;\\forall\\bar b\\in B^n\\;(\\Omega(n)(i)(\\bar b)\\in B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S(\\phi,\\langle A,\\Omega\\rangle,\\langle A&#39;,\\Omega&#39;\\rangle,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\land\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A&#39;,\\Omega&#39;,I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,A&#39;)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in I(n)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;(\\phi(\\Omega(n)(i)(\\bar a))=\\Omega&#39;(n)(i)(\\phi\\circ\\bar a))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S(\\phi,\\langle A,\\Omega\\rangle,\\langle A&#39;,\\Omega&#39;\\rangle,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\land\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A&#39;,\\Omega&#39;,I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,A&#39;)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in I(n)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;(\\phi(\\Omega(n)(i)(\\bar a))=\\Omega&#39;(n)(i)(\\phi\\circ\\bar a))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Algebraic structure: a nonempty carrier with a set-coded family of finitary operations.  Equational identities are additional theory data, not part of the bare signature structure.</li>\n<li>Examples: group <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G, \\cdot, ^{-1}, e)\">\\((G, \\cdot, ^{-1}, e)\\)</span>, ring <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R, +, \\cdot, 0, 1)\">\\((R, +, \\cdot, 0, 1)\\)</span>, lattice</li>\n<li>Birkhoff: varieties = equational classes = homomorphic images of free algebras</li>\n<li>Category of algebras: morphisms are homomorphisms preserving all operations</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Burris and Sankappanavar, A Course in Universal Algebra</li>\n<li>Cohn, Universal Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md","status":"resolved","id":"788f4256d9b974d6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,A'\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I,\\Omega,\\Omega'\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(I))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega(n),I(n),A^{A^n})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure\\text{-}arity} \\vdash \\tau_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,|I(i)|\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Substructure}_S(B,A,\\Omega,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\land\\varnothing\\neq B\\subseteq A\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in I(n)\\;\\forall\\bar b\\in B^n\\;(\\Omega(n)(i)(\\bar b)\\in B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}structure\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S(\\phi,\\langle A,\\Omega\\rangle,\\langle A',\\Omega'\\rangle,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\land\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A',\\Omega',I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,A')\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in I(n)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;(\\phi(\\Omega(n)(i)(\\bar a))=\\Omega'(n)(i)(\\phi\\circ\\bar a))","display":true},{"tex":"(G, \\cdot, ^{-1}, e)","display":false},{"tex":"(R, +, \\cdot, 0, 1)","display":false}],"bytes":2556,"backlinks":[{"id":"29d3779cb3a059e6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(A,\\Omega)$ and $(B,\\Omega')$ (algebraic structures with the common operation-index family $I$, see [[58-df-algebraic-structure]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-structure.md|58-df-algebraic-structure]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","788f4256d9b974d6","36d7463d215be751"]}